#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Mart/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Mart_Text_XSpeedFirstStrike"
msgid ""
"Use X SPEED to add to a POKéMON's\n"
"SPEED in battle.\p"
"That will help it get in the first\n"
"strike--a decided advantage!$"
msgstr ""
"在战斗中使用速度强化，\n"
"可以提高宝可梦的速度。\p"
"这样就能抢先出手——绝对是一大优势！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Mart/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Mart_Text_LocalSpecialtyOnMtChimney"
msgid ""
"On MT. CHIMNEY's peak, there's a local\n"
"specialty that you can buy only there.\p"
"Give it to a POKéMON--it will be elated.$"
msgstr ""
"烟囱山的山顶上有一种只能在\n"
"那里买到的特产。\p"
"把它给宝可梦，它会高兴得不得了。$"
